    <string name="data_sources">Data sources</string>
    <string name="sources">• Sun: NOAA Solar Calculator equations (J. Meeus, “Astronomical Algorithms”), computed on the phone.\n• Moon: Paul Schlyter\'s algorithm (“How to compute planetary positions”), computed on the phone and checked against PyEphem.\n• Weather: meteoblue AG (basic-1h / basic-day package). Weather data © meteoblue.\n• Place search: Android geocoding service (Google).\n• Weather icons: Material Symbols by Google, Apache License 2.0.\n• Radar and rain map: Windy.com embedded map (shown as provided by Windy, logo included).\n• Weather alerts (Italy): Italian Civil Protection Department, national criticality bulletin and alert zones, CC BY 4.0.\n• Last 24 h temperature: Open-Meteo.com (CC BY 4.0), model values for the place.\n• Webcams: Windy Webcams API, webcams provided by windy.com; the pages in “My webcams” belong to their owners.</string>
